1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,500
Can an AI agent refund on its own?
Sounds risky, right?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
ReturnLens says not yet: damage refunds
stay locked on the live demo.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:16,000
The courier confirms the return parcel.
Does the agent refund immediately?

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Not here. It drafts a refund proposal,
and waits for seller review.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Why? One of its tests is synthetic,
and that never counts.

6
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:35,500
Meet the multi-case inbox:
order facts, seen evidence, unverified.

7
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:41,000
An immutable audit drawer
tracks every single event in code.

8
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:47,500
A customer asks where her order is.
The agent checks live Delhivery data.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Immediate tracking status and ETA,
answered without human delay.

10
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:02,000
Delivery failed for Sneha Patil.
The agent reaches out right away.

11
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:08,200
She texts an address change in Hinglish:
Flat 14B, tomorrow at 6 PM.

12
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:13,200
Parsed into a reattempt proposal,
scheduled with a single click.

13
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:19,500
Now, multimodal evidence:
an unboxing clip and English voice note.

14
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:27,000
The catalog says white headphones.
At 00:10, vision spots black!

15
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:33,000
No guessing, no false claims.
The box barcode remains unverified.

16
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:37,400
Zero rogue proposals created:
transferred directly to human review.

17
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:45,000
A dark video shows no visible damage.
The agent asks once for a clear photo.

18
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:51,500
The customer leaves and returns later...
the entire chat and context restore.

19
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:57,200
It remembers preferred language Hinglish,
so it never asks twice.

20
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:03,500
How does an agent earn autonomy?
By passing 5 of 5 runs in the harness.

21
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,500
9 of 10 scenarios pass 5 of 5.
Mismatch sits at 4 of 5... locked.

22
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,600
Nervous? One click on the kill switch
takes back total control.

23
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:19,500
Try to break it in the sandbox:
prompt injection neutralized.

24
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:25,600
Over-refunds and velocity attacks:
hard-blocked by code invariants!

25
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:30,000
ReturnLens.
Every decision, backed by evidence.
